                          "name": "Chat / Voice Button / Default",
                          "context": "Voice input button (default state). 34×34 pill, transparent background with border. Tapping starts speech-to-text recording via Cartesia. Place in input field secondary buttons area. States: default, hover, pressed, active (recording).",
