                          "id": "AxAod",
                          "name": "Chat / Send Button / Default",
                          "context": "Primary send button for submitting chat messages. 34×34 pill, dark fill ($chat.send.bg) with white arrow-up icon. Place at the right end of the input field button row. States: default, hover, pressed, disabled.",
